# Silithus (59-60): the Horde quests of Silithus and Cenarion Hold, for a Horde duo. The last guide
# of the Horde 40-60 sequence.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/silithus_59_60.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Silithus, area 1377). The
# guide's quest list is section 24 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md.
# Carried in: Wasteland (1124) and A Reliquary of Purity (5527), from Rabine Saturna in Moonglade;
# Taking Back Silithus (8276), from Cenarion Emissary Blackhoof in Orgrimmar.
# Carried in too: Are We There, Yeti? (5163), from Umi Rumplesnicker in Everlook, handed in after a
# last flight from Moonglade to Everlook.
# Left out:
# - The Calling (8315): a raid quest; the Qiraji emissary it summons is a level 63 boss.
# - The Path of the Righteous (8301), Anachronos (8303), Long Forgotten Memories (8305) and A Pawn
#   on the Eternal Board (8519): the Scepter of the Shifting Sands chain, after Only One May Rise
#   (Blackwing Lair).
# - Bang a Gong! (8743) and Treasure of the Timeless One (8745): the opening of the gates of
#   Ahn'Qiraj, after the Scepter.
# - The Perfect Poison (9023): its venom sacs drop in Zul'Gurub and the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj.
# - Goldleaf's Discovery (8343), Lords of the Council (8341) and Bor Wishes to Speak (8351): they
#   need Revered with the Cenarion Circle. Scepter of the Council (8352) and A Humble Offering (9248):
#   their Abyssal Scepter drops from the Abyssal Lords, level 63 raid bosses.
#
# The route: Valor's Rest and Southwind Village on the way in; Cenarion Hold; the north (Dredge
# Strikers, scorpids, Layo), the Twilight tablets in the north-west and the cultists' base camp;
# the south (the Southwind tower, Hermit Ortell, General Kirika, Bronzebeard's Encampment, the
# south-western and central Twilight camps); the hives (Hive'Regal, Hive'Zora, Hive'Ashi) with the
# dwarves' glyphs and brains, finishing level 60; the central Twilight camp (geolords, Templars);
# the dwarves, Ortell, Layo and Vyral the Vile in one loop; the Abyssal Council; the Caverns of
# Time; Moonglade for the last hand-ins.
# No auction house stop: the guide before ends in Un'Goro Crater and the route passes no Horde city.
# The one Large Brilliant Shard Aurel Goldleaf wants comes from an enchanter or any auction house.

guide Silithus (59-60)
faction horde
levels 59 60
carry 1124 5163 5527 8276

# Valor's Rest and Southwind Village ---------------------------------------------------------------

map Silithus
note "Ride from Marshal's Refuge out of Un'Goro Crater by the pass on its western rim: the road comes out in Silithus at Valor's Rest" at 81.9,18.9
turnin 1124
tip Layo Starstrike stands among the graves of Valor's Rest.
accept 1125
do 1125 bg
do 5527 icon use "Open the Dusty Reliquary"
tip The Dusty Reliquary sits inside the ruined building on the east side of Southwind Village.
do 1125
tip Silithid roam the village too: pull carefully and fight close together.

