# The south: Southwind tower, Hermit Ortell, General Kirika -----------------------------------------

do 8281 bg at 49.4,56.7
do 1126 at 60.2,52.5
tip Climb to the top of the Southwind tower and disturb the Gooey Nest there: two Hive'Ashi Ambushers burst out on the top floor, and one carries the object. Three Hive'Ashi Drones also appear as you enter the tower's bottom floor: be ready.
turnin 8285
tip Hermit Ortell hides in a small cave in the eastern hills.
