do 9422 at 60.6,63.0 icon use "Pick up Silithyst at a geyser and bring it to the Horde extractor by General Kirika"
tip Silithyst Geysers erupt at different places in the desert and leave a glowing mound: walk over it to carry the Silithyst, then walk into the extractor. The Alliance can take it from you.
