tip Twilight Keeper Exeter walks around the Twilight camp in the south-west. He stuns and uses Mortal Strike: keep him on whoever can take it.
do 8278.2 at 32.5,36.7
do 8281 at 29.4,42.2
do 8279.1 at 26.4,36.6
tip Twilight Keeper Mayna walks the cultists' base camp in the north-west. Her Psychic Scream is an instant fear: clear the cultists around first so it doesn't send you into them.
do 8279.3 at 40.9,42.2
tip Twilight Keeper Havunth walks the east side of the Twilight camp west of Cenarion Hold. He hits very hard in bursts: open with your cooldowns.

