tip Deathclasp is a level 59 elite scorpion in the mountains south of the dwarves' camp; Noggle's Satchel lies near her, so loot it without waking her. She patrols with adds: pull them off and kite them until she resets, then fight her alone. She hits hard and poisons: keep her off your casters.
