# The Twilight camp west of Cenarion Hold -----------------------------------------------------------

do 8320 at 39.3,43.9
do 8361 at 39.0,42.4 icon kill "Wear the Twilight Trappings and summon an Abyssal Templar at the Lesser Wind Stone"
tip Put on the Twilight Cultist Cowl, Mantle and Robe and use the Lesser Wind Stone: an Abyssal Templar (a level 60 elite) answers. Each Templar drops one crest, so summon one for each of you. If the pieces have not dropped, the auction house sells them.
note "Summon three more Templars each and keep their crests for Aurel Goldleaf" at 38.3,46.5
tip The crests are not quest items: they stay in your bags until Aurel Goldleaf asks for them.

